{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10017_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ca0aeea9eeb1790a630774ee954c59d68206b50904422607475782d4b87ab902",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c97819649a76d7e697c2292419423699860c0e448ec2cc2e48e4a30d7ced6626",
      "text": "百百人……？\n商讨已经结束了哦……不回去吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0d619eb21c95d16e2b65e0cdc7b2bb19bc6b0e6f54561bb023d6a5d997aac8c",
      "text": "啊，嗯。我想把今天拿到的资料\n再多研读一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:085ec63a35c692588855ad408bbaf3f0e77567d160c49402382ac1f2bbd51a3d",
      "text": "……这样啊。那我也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19431efc53d76c4ae1a8b4eba5a4979972a5b1bf49fa77eb477749a990c7847c",
      "text": "刚才的榊君，好帅气啊。\n明明不擅长，却还是想去尝试。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a80f6dc5ee18c2f090692ac97310e5c0a34e78d5024f9ad82ed9a87d3032dd1a",
      "text": "百百人……擅长恋爱话题吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6407b21d5ef577df4b0e1a714a3d3e944e0008e723f7afeab925dcc128f0d1f5",
      "text": "没有啦。我也算不上擅长哦。\n因为没什么经验嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3fa84133cc7bc5c911601cc1c661725990d44ce93c12dbcf60068d1add9b213",
      "text": "……榊君为什么会不擅长呢？\n该不会……是有喜欢的人了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4a5b7072b2e0665dd673d88aa35a14bc03be67758c93f0005ef5ac60d550696",
      "text": "嗯……\n不过我觉得，和恋爱可能有点不太一样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:279cb46e050fc6521aa035a9dc8602535f965edd6abaa8508b442e0960cbe7a6",
      "text": "我有一个……一直觉得非常重要的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a18507e074231d7a008cf9a1f2fedcf049a5a0465db37c36f0103393b1bfec4d",
      "text": "为了那个人的话……我什么都愿意做。\n只要那个人能幸福……我就会觉得开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abe18d8536f56f38f231fb459cadc6ca2775afb7a62431ebeee12f17b82a29e5",
      "text": "（……你也能够这么直率地\n用语言表达出来啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_d:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab8ec0f801ae8c3fb39f2beacb1eff7bd505f33245502ba5bf8ee8af460b8b07",
      "text": "（在这家事务所里的……全都是坚强的人啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
